# See fixtures/117_guard_fault.ds.
#
#   pump 1  P joins the clock tick; the guard faults (no resolver): a DOMAIN
#           ComputationError and no firing
#
# `wall 0` so that the one fault is `local()`'s and not `now()`'s: `now()`
# read while the wall clock is unset faults.
wall 0
assert P id=1
pump
